DEVICE SPIKE

# Robot Lab: a drawing robot.
# Model: Drawing robot (the SPIKE driving base, wheels on A and B; its castor ball is
# marked "Draws on the floor", so it draws a line wherever it rolls).
# Four times: drive 20 cm, then turn a quarter on the spot. That is a square.
# The ball sits behind the wheels, so at each corner its line swings round in a loop.
# Try a triangle: 3 times, a third of a turn (120°) each.
WHEN flag clicked:
  set movement motors A B
  set movement speed 30
  REPEAT 4:
    move forward 20 cm
    reset yaw
    start tank 20 -20
    wait until (spike angle yaw) > 88
    stop movement
    wait 0.3 seconds
